## Why This Is Asked
This question probes multi-tenant runtime schema negotiation and governance in a cross-region telemetry pipeline, plus dynamic masking controls.

## Key Concepts
- Dynamic schema negotiation with DynamoDB-backed registry
- Per-tenant feature flags/masks
- Idempotence and late data handling
- OpenTelemetry for auditability across regions
- Data governance with Glue/Athena partitions

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: pick schema by version, apply masking, write to tenant prefix
function processEvent(evt){
  const v = getSchemaVersion(evt.tenantId);
  const schema = loadSchema(v);
  const deserialized = deserialize(evt.payload, schema);
  const masked = applyMasking(deserialized, evt.tenantId);
  writeToS3(masked, evt.tenantId);
}
```

